# Files `vercel deploy` (CLI) must never upload. The CLI does NOT read
# .gitignore — without this file, local-only files would ship to Vercel's
# deployment source storage. Mirrors .gitignore; backups/ holds pg_dump
# output with user data (charter §11.2) and must never leave the machine.
backups/
.env*
.vercel
node_modules
.next
*.log
*.txt
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/*.png
